<div class="modal fade" id="rpTermsModal" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="rpTermsModalLabel" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered modal-lg">
        <div class="modal-content rp-terms-modal">
            <div class="modal-header rp-terms-modal-header">
                <h2 class="modal-title h5 mb-0" id="rpTermsModalLabel">Terms &amp; Conditions</h2>
                <button type="button" class="btn-close btn-close-white" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body rp-terms-modal-body" data-rp-terms-modal-body>
                <div class="rp-legal-section" id="modal-booking-rules">
                    <h3>Booking rules</h3>
                    <p>A reservation made through this website is confirmed automatically when you submit it, subject to availability. You must be at least 18 years old, or have a guardian booking for you, to make a reservation. Please make sure the details you submit are correct. We may decline or change a booking if it goes over the accommodation's maximum capacity.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="rp-legal-section" id="modal-payment">
                    <h3>Payment</h3>
                    <p>We accept Cash, GCash, Bank Transfer, and other methods you can arrange with front desk staff. We may ask for full or partial payment to confirm a booking, and any remaining balance is due on or before check-in unless we agree otherwise. Once our staff verifies a payment, it's recorded against your reservation and you get a receipt.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="rp-legal-section" id="modal-cancellation-refund">
                    <h3>Cancellation &amp; refund policy</h3>
                    <p><strong>Please read this section carefully before you confirm your booking or payment.</strong> By submitting a reservation and payment, you agree to these terms. You can cancel a Pending or Approved reservation from your guest dashboard, or by contacting front desk directly. Cancel 7 or more days before check-in and you'll get a full refund. Cancel 2 to 6 days before check-in and you'll get a 50% refund. Cancel less than 48 hours before check-in, or don't show up, and it's non-refundable. Approved refunds go back to your original payment method within 5 to 10 business days. We may also cancel a reservation and give a full refund if something like a double-booking error happens, or if something outside our control comes up.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="rp-legal-section" id="modal-check-in-out">
                    <h3>Check-in &amp; check-out</h3>
                    <p>Check-in is at 2:00 PM and check-out is at 12:00 PM (noon), unless you've arranged something different with us in advance. Our front desk is open 24/7 to help with arrivals and departures. You'll need a valid government ID at check-in for the guest named on the reservation. Early check-in or late check-out depends on availability and may cost extra.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="rp-legal-section" id="modal-guest-responsibilities">
                    <h3>Guest responsibilities</h3>
                    <p>You're responsible for your whole group, including any visitors you bring on-site. You're also responsible for any loss or damage to resort property caused by you, your group, or your visitors. Please don't go over the maximum capacity listed for your accommodation. Illegal activity or behavior that puts other guests or staff at risk may get you removed from the resort without a refund.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="rp-legal-section" id="modal-liability">
                    <h3>Liability</h3>
                    <p>You use resort facilities, including the pool, beach area, and common spaces, at your own risk. Guanzon Resort isn't liable for loss, theft, or damage to personal belongings unless it's our fault. As far as the law allows, our liability for any claim about your stay is limited to what you paid for that reservation.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="rp-legal-section" id="modal-changes-to-reservations">
                    <h3>Changes to reservations</h3>
                    <p>If you need to change your dates, accommodation, or guest count, contact front desk as early as you can. Changes depend on availability. Sometimes we may need to move a confirmed booking to a similar or better accommodation because of something unexpected, and we'll always reach out to you first if that happens. Got questions about these Terms? Email us at <a href="mailto:info@guanzonresort.com">info@guanzonresort.com</a> or call 09190644054.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
